; idxtriu_intermediate_overflow: the mirror of
; idxgrid_intermediate_overflow on the triangular index.
;
; i = 0, j = 2^32. j * (j - 1) = 2^64 - 2^32 is not representable; the
; halved result 2^63 - 2^31 is. Range-checking only the pushed value
; therefore accepts the program, which is what xqvm_py did.

PUSH 0                     ; i
PUSH 4294967296            ; j
IDXTRIU
HALT
